{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1182334-clarification-on-connection-invocation","id":1182334,"title":"Clarification on Connection invocation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-04T11:29:55-08:00","id":1182334,"title":"Clarification on Connection invocation","content":"On page 110 it says:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i><b>Once per session</b>,</i> a Path can call upon a connection (a group of associates on similar Paths), or a contact (someone specific related to your Path). </div> </div> </div>But on page 112 it says:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Each connection may only be called upon <b>twice in a single session</b>. If the Path has already been invoked twice this session, you can still invoke it for more dots. The first time you do so, your character gains the Suspended Condition. If you try a second time beyond your limit in the Session, the character gains the Revoked Condition. </div> </div> </div>(Emphasis mine.) So which is it, once per session, or twice per session and can invoke it more so long as you're willing to pick up Conditions?<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> A second thing, just to be sure I'm reading this right: When you invoke a contact, you get more dots to either gain new contacts or improve the ones you've got. So through the general course of playing and leveraging contacts, the character will gain a growing catalog of contacts, and those contacts will keep on getting better and better. (And if the second option above is true, then you could get 4-8 dots per session for increasing contacts. Which seems like a lot.) That accurate?","